<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-σχετός</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνσχετός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>endurable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				119
			</span></i>: mostly with negat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου᾽ γὰρ ἔτ᾽ ἀνσχετὰ ἔργα τετεύχαται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					2.63
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεσεῖν . . πτώματ᾽ οὐκ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					919
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρέμματ᾽ ούκ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					182
				</span></i>
			; so with a question expecting a negative answer, S <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				987
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ. [ἐστι</span>], c. acc.
			et inf., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.207
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.81
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				8.142
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῆν γὰρ κακῶς κλύουσαν οὐκ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					721
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				1652
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ. ποιεῖσθαί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.163
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκέτι ἀ. ἐποιοῦντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.118
				</span></i>
			.</div>
